            },
            "chunk_type": "executive_biography",
            "content": "Terry Rice, Chief Security Officer, Vice President of Cybersecurity, chairs the Council and is responsible for overseeing a unified security program that provides cybersecurity, fire and protection operations, physical security, insider threat, and classified security. Mr. Rice has over 25 years of experience within cybersecurity and technology risk management, including, prior to joining Boeing in 2025, serving as the Chief Information Security Officer at Merck.",
